  m_Name: Weapons_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: cb25aec90c44839419fb18446edc0823, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 179597115392
    m_Localized: Throwing Axe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 448816906240
    m_Localized: Throw an axe which crits after bouncing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1017233178624
    m_Localized: Blaster
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1054394712064
    m_Localized: Shoots directly forward; hold to charge and crit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 693175850270720
    m_Localized: Boomerang
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 693363667009536
    m_Localized: Tosses forward then returns, critting on the way back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 693788629696512
    m_Localized: Caltrops
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 693859286941696
    m_Localized: Spread several caltrops in front of you. They crit when they stop
      moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694069052473344
    m_Localized: Daggers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694115936403456
    m_Localized: Slice forward and back with a pair of daggers. The one in back crits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694237437001728
    m_Localized: Glaive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694287273721856
    m_Localized: Slice in front of you, then push the button again to stab and crit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694422422585344
    m_Localized: Grenade
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694468736090112
    m_Localized: Throw a grenade, then wait or push the button again to explode it.
      The inner part of the explosion crits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694737934909440
    m_Localized: Hammer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694767018213376
    m_Localized: Throw a hammer upward. It crits until it starts to fall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694877328408576
    m_Localized: Kick
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 694915660152832
    m_Localized: Kick below and around you, propelling yourself upward if it hits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695076809506816
    m_Localized: Throwing Knives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695139447242752
    m_Localized: Hold to charge up several knives, then throw them in a set pattern.
      The last two charged will crit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695336319483904
    m_Localized: Lance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695367197949952
    m_Localized: Hold a lance in front of you, which crits when you dash. Stays held
      up until you stop dashing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695616901644288
    m_Localized: Missile
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695651991191552
    m_Localized: Shoot a missile which starts slow but accelerates. When it hits
      it explodes, tossing back crit-exploding segments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695909043306496
    m_Localized: Sword
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 695949358956544
    m_Localized: Slash in front of you. In the air, hit an enemy slightly below to
      crit and bounce yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
